You are so infused with sunlight that your body glows permanently in radius [3, 5, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)], even in dark places.

Your vision and body adapt to this glow, giving you [18%, 36%, 46%, 54%, 60% (TL1-5)] blindness resistance, [15%, 21%, 26%, 31%, 35% (TL1-5)] light resistance, and [12%, 19%, 24%, 27%, 30% (TL1-5)] light affinity.

The light radius overrides your normal light if it is bigger (it does not stack).
